      "id": "claim_25cf829cc2a6468da084fd96ee2a2f55",
      "statement": "FlexAnnotate's tests are split in two tiers: pure Zotero-free logic (src/features/<feature>/logic/, src/core/, src/shared/feature.ts) is tested with Node's built-in runner (`node --test \"test-unit/*.test.ts\"`) in test-unit/ without any Zotero requirement, while behavior that needs Zotero (items, tags, menus, windows, prototype patches) runs as Mocha tests in test/ inside a real Zotero instance launched through zotero-plugin-scaffold.",
